Lab 16: Automate Role and Playbook Management
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

• Create and configure Ansible roles with proper directory structure and components • Implement roles within playbooks for modular automation • Test roles with different playbook configurations and variables • Understand best practices for role-based automation management • Apply role dependencies and conditional logic in complex scenarios

