Task 1: Create and Configure an Ansible Role
Subtask 1.1: Initialize Role Directory Structure
First, let's create a proper Ansible role structure using the ansible-galaxy command.

Connect to your control node and navigate to your working directory:
cd /home/student
mkdir ansible-lab16
cd ansible-lab16
Create a new role called webserver using ansible-galaxy:
ansible-galaxy init webserver
Examine the created directory structure:
tree webserver/
You should see the following structure:

webserver/
├── README.md
├── defaults/
│   └── main.yml
├── files/
├── handlers/
│   └── main.yml
├── meta/
│   └── main.yml
├── tasks/
│   └── main.yml
├── templates/
├── tests/
│   ├── inventory
│   └── test.yml
└── vars/
    └── main.yml
Subtask 1.2: Configure Role Variables
Edit the default variables for the webserver role:
vim webserver/defaults/main.yml
Add the following content:

---
# defaults file for webserver
webserver_package: httpd
webserver_service: httpd
webserver_port: 80
document_root: /var/www/html
index_file: index.html
server_admin: admin@example.com
Create role-specific variables in the vars directory:
vim webserver/vars/main.yml
Add the following content:

---
# vars file for webserver
firewall_service: firewalld
required_packages:
  - "{{ webserver_package }}"
  - firewalld
  - python3-firewall
Subtask 1.3: Define Role Tasks
Create the main tasks file for the webserver role:
vim webserver/tasks/main.yml
Add the following comprehensive task list:

---
# tasks file for webserver
- name: Install required packages
  yum:
    name: "{{ required_packages }}"
    state: present
  become: yes

- name: Start and enable firewall service
  systemd:
    name: "{{ firewall_service }}"
    state: started
    enabled: yes
  become: yes

- name: Configure firewall for HTTP traffic
  firewalld:
    service: http
    permanent: yes
    state: enabled
    immediate: yes
  become: yes
  notify: restart firewall

- name: Create document root directory
  file:
    path: "{{ document_root }}"
    state: directory
    owner: apache
    group: apache
    mode: '0755'
  become: yes

- name: Deploy index.html from template
  template:
    src: index.html.j2
    dest: "{{ document_root }}/{{ index_file }}"
    owner: apache
    group: apache
    mode: '0644'
  become: yes
  notify: restart webserver

- name: Start and enable webserver service
  systemd:
    name: "{{ webserver_service }}"
    state: started
    enabled: yes
  become: yes
