Task 2: Use Roles in Playbooks
Subtask 2.1: Create Basic Role-Based Playbook
Create an inventory file for your managed nodes:
vim inventory.ini
Add your managed nodes:

[webservers]
node1 ansible_host=<node1_ip_address>
node2 ansible_host=<node2_ip_address>

[all:vars]
ansible_user=student
ansible_ssh_private_key_file=~/.ssh/id_rsa
Create a basic playbook that uses the webserver role:
vim deploy-webserver.yml
Add the following playbook content:

---
- name: Deploy Web Servers using Role
  hosts: webservers
  become: yes
  roles:
    - webserver
Run the playbook to test the basic role functionality:
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini deploy-webserver.yml
Subtask 2.2: Create Advanced Role-Based Playbook with Variables
Create a more complex playbook with role variables and multiple configurations:
vim advanced-webserver.yml
Add the following advanced playbook:

---
- name: Deploy Web Servers with Custom Configuration
  hosts: webservers
  become: yes
  vars:
    custom_server_admin: "lab-admin@alnafi.com"
    custom_port: 8080
  
  pre_tasks:
    - name: Update system packages
      yum:
        name: '*'
        state: latest
      when: ansible_os_family == "RedHat"

  roles:
    - role: webserver
      vars:
        server_admin: "{{ custom_server_admin }}"
        webserver_port: "{{ custom_port }}"
      tags: ['webserver', 'apache']

  post_tasks:
    - name: Verify web service is running
      uri:
        url: "http://{{ ansible_default_ipv4.address }}:{{ custom_port }}"
        method: GET
        status_code: 200
      delegate_to: localhost
      ignore_errors: yes
Subtask 2.3: Create Role-Based Playbook with Conditional Logic
Create a conditional playbook that applies different configurations based on host groups:
vim conditional-webserver.yml
Add the following conditional playbook:

---
- name: Deploy Web Servers with Conditional Configuration
  hosts: all
  become: yes
  vars:
    development_config:
      server_admin: "dev-admin@alnafi.com"
      webserver_port: 8080
      index_file: "dev-index.html"
    
    production_config:
      server_admin: "prod-admin@alnafi.com"
      webserver_port: 80
      index_file: "index.html"

  tasks:
    - name: Apply webserver role for development environment
      include_role:
        name: webserver
      vars:
        server_admin: "{{ development_config.server_admin }}"
        webserver_port: "{{ development_config.webserver_port }}"
        index_file: "{{ development_config.index_file }}"
      when: inventory_hostname == "node1"
      tags: ['development']

    - name: Apply webserver role for production environment
      include_role:
        name: webserver
      vars:
        server_admin: "{{ production_config.server_admin }}"
        webserver_port: "{{ production_config.webserver_port }}"
        index_file: "{{ production_config.index_file }}"
      when: inventory_hostname == "node2"
      tags: ['production']
