Subtask 3.5: Performance and Validation Testing
Create a validation playbook to test role functionality:
vim validate-webserver.yml
Add comprehensive validation tasks:

---
- name: Validate Webserver Role Deployment
  hosts: webservers
  become: yes
  
  tasks:
    - name: Check if httpd package is installed
      yum:
        list: httpd
      register: httpd_package
    
    - name: Verify httpd service is running
      systemd:
        name: httpd
      register: httpd_service
    
    - name: Check firewall configuration
      firewalld:
        service: http
        state: enabled
        permanent: yes
      check_mode: yes
      register: firewall_config
    
    - name: Test web server response
      uri:
        url: "http://{{ ansible_default_ipv4.address }}"
        method: GET
        status_code: 200
      delegate_to: localhost
      register: web_response
    
    - name: Display validation results
      debug:
        msg: |
          Package Status: {{ 'Installed' if httpd_package.results else 'Not Installed' }}
          Service Status: {{ httpd_service.status.ActiveState }}
          Firewall Status: {{ 'Configured' if not firewall_config.changed else 'Not Configured' }}
          Web Response: {{ 'Success' if web_response.status == 200 else 'Failed' }}
Run the validation playbook:
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini validate-webserver.yml
Create a performance test using Ansible's timing features:
vim performance-test.yml
Add performance testing tasks:

---
- name: Performance Test Role Deployment
  hosts: webservers
  become: yes
  
  tasks:
    - name: Time role execution
      block:
        - name: Record start time
          set_fact:
            start_time: "{{ ansible_date_time.epoch }}"
        
        - name: Apply webserver role
          include_role:
            name: webserver
        
        - name: Record end time
          set_fact:
            end_time: "{{ ansible_date_time.epoch }}"
        
        - name: Calculate execution time
          debug:
            msg: "Role execution time: {{ (end_time | int) - (start_time | int) }} seconds"
Run the performance test:
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini performance-test.yml
Troubleshooting Common Issues
Issue 1: Role Not Found Error
If you encounter "role not found" errors:

# Verify role directory structure
ls -la webserver/

# Check ansible.cfg for roles_path
cat ansible.cfg

# Ensure you're running playbooks from the correct directory
pwd
Issue 2: Template Rendering Issues
If templates fail to render:

# Check template syntax
ansible-playbook --syntax-check -i inventory.ini deploy-webserver.yml

# Test template rendering manually
ansible webservers -i inventory.ini -m setup | grep ansible_hostname
Issue 3: Handler Not Triggering
If handlers don't execute:

# Force handler execution
ansible-playbook -i inventory.ini deploy-webserver.yml --force-handlers

# Check handler syntax in handlers/main.yml
ansible-playbook --syntax-check -i inventory.ini deploy-webserver.yml
